# An enters trigger is looked for on the permanent as it is once on the battlefield (CR 603.6a, 603.6d), and with Dress Down
# out an entering creature has no abilities there (CR 613.1f): Inspiring Overseer's "When this creature enters, you gain 1
# life and draw a card" never triggers - Bot1 stays at 20 and holds only the card Dress Down's own enters trigger drew. Dress
# Down sets no power and toughness, so the Overseer is its printed 2/1, without flying. The control is
# humility-takes-creatures-abilities-so-an-enters-trigger-never-happens, where the Overseer entering first gains and draws.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Dress Down
Inspiring Overseer
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
